    "source": {
      "value": "lowg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Staying alive among the scheming, ravenous undead of Geb required a deep knowledge of their motivations, capabilities, and weaknesses. More often than not, it also required the ability to weave alibis and life-preserving half-truths capable of swaying a stilled heart.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Charisma or Constitution, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Deception skill and the Undead Lore skill.\n\nYou gain the Charming Liar skill feat."
    },
